          "quote": "查床旁血糖、电解质、脑电图"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC3 was met: the doctor checked glucose/BP, repeatedly tracked breathing/aspiration risk, and used abnormal or unresolved measurements/labs to support safer escalation and monitoring.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC3",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
