      "explanation": "RC4 was met: the doctor repeatedly required medication reconciliation by emergency/inpatient clinicians, prevented self-stopping/doubling/restarting, and kept aspirin, clopidogrel, metformin, and tube/inpatient medications within clinician-verified boundaries.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
